WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.751
Theo: We've got to get Frankie out of that trunk.

2
00:00:08.752 --> 00:00:11.485
Ben: He'll die without food and water.

3
00:00:11.486 --> 00:00:13.715
Theo: Don't worry, Frankie.

4
00:00:13.716 --> 00:00:17.666
We'll get you out!

5
00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:20.303
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

6
00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:22.702
Sarah: Frankie sounds scared.

7
00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:24.849
Skyler: And thirsty.

8
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:31.980
Snooks: Ah-choo!

9
00:00:31.981 --> 00:00:34.638
Ben: Maybe we could break the trunk open.

10
00:00:34.639 --> 00:00:38.147
Theo: I don't want to hurt Frankie!

11
00:00:38.148 --> 00:00:41.723
Skyler: Look, Chatter has something in his beak.

12
00:00:41.724 --> 00:00:45.890
Riley: A shiny, gold key!

13
00:00:45.891 --> 00:00:47.970
Ben: It is a key.

14
00:00:47.971 --> 00:00:50.383
Maybe it's the key to the trunk.

15
00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:55.726
Skyler: Chatter, let me have the key.

16
00:00:55.727 --> 00:00:59.140
Sarah: He doesn't want to let it go.

17
00:00:59.141 --> 00:01:02.984
Skyler: Chatter, open your beak!

18
00:01:02.985 --> 00:01:04.970
Chatter: No!

19
00:01:04.971 --> 00:01:07.603
Kids: Ha-ha!

20
00:01:07.604 --> 00:01:14.957
Skyler: Thank you, Chatter.

21
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:23.921
Theo: I wish for this key to work.

22
00:01:23.922 --> 00:01:26.174
Ben: Hooray!

23
00:01:26.175 --> 00:01:29.850
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

24
00:01:29.851 --> 00:01:33.022
Sarah: The key worked like magic.

25
00:01:33.023 --> 00:01:37.066
Riley: Hmm. That makes me wonder.

26
00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:38.537
Ben: What?

27
00:01:38.538 --> 00:01:45.572
Riley: What if this key really is magic?

28
00:01:45.573 --> 00:01:47.509
Skyler: What do you mean?

29
00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:52.390
Riley: Well, Theo made a wish that the key would work.

30
00:01:52.391 --> 00:01:54.834
Theo: And it did!

31
00:01:54.835 --> 00:01:59.393
Ben: Let's try another wish.

32
00:01:59.394 --> 00:02:02.930
Riley: Be careful what you wish for.

33
00:02:02.931 --> 00:02:04.796
Sarah: Why?

34
00:02:04.797 --> 00:02:08.112
Riley: Because your wish may come true.

35
00:02:08.113 --> 00:02:13.938
That's what my mom always says.

36
00:02:13.939 --> 00:02:17.391
Theo: We want our wishes to come true.

37
00:02:17.392 --> 00:02:22.301
Riley: We should still think carefully about our next wish.

38
00:02:22.302 --> 00:02:27.197
Skyler: Let me make a wish! I wish—

39
00:02:27.198 --> 00:02:34.313
Theo: For the Pet Lovers Club to become famous!

